# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim). For a death (now the sfx `death`, game/flow.js).
# Not played by the game yet: only in tools/player.html, under Jingles.
# The ring of the victory jingle and the title's shatter, then the toy tune trying again.
title    Death
composer Claude
about    "No... that's not how it went." A knock and the long thin glass ring while time stands still, then the shatter: glass falling, the bird's call narrowed to a half step, a low swell. Then the toy tune tries again (A B C), and the bird's wide call comes back with a shimmer: back at the entry.
tempo    90
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.55

# mood explore: lead bird sweep harm swell ring bowl knock bass shatter chimes

voice lead     crystal    vol=0.75 pan=-0.1
voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.4  rev=0.75
voice sweep    crystal    vol=0.26 pan=0.35 rev=0.65
voice harm     glassharp  vol=0.26 pan=-0.2 center=A4 att=0.2 rel=1.2
voice swell    glassharp  vol=0.3  pan=-0.1 att=0.8 rel=1.4
voice ring     glassharp  vol=0.2  pan=0.3  rev=0.8 att=0.1 rel=1
voice bowl     bowl       vol=0.4  pan=-0.1
voice knock    kick       vol=0.4
voice bass     fretless   vol=0.6
voice shatter  shatter    vol=0.5  pan=0.15
voice chimes   chimes     vol=0.4  pan=-0.3

# the blow and the ring; the shatter, glass falling, the narrowed call over a low swell
pattern fall
knock   | X..... ...... | _ |
bass    | D1!- .--------- | D1----------- |
ring    | G6----------- | -- .--------- |
shatter | _ | X..... ...... |
chimes  | _ | x..x.. ...... |
lead    | _ | E7! B6? A6 F6? D6 Bb5? .----- |
bird    | _ | .----- A6 A5+Bb5---- |
swell   | _ | D2+A2+D3----------- |

# the toy tune tries again, and the wide call comes back with a shimmer
pattern back tempo=72
lead    | A4- B4- C5- .----- |
bird    | .----- A6 A5+B5---- |
sweep   | .----- A5 B5 E6 A6 B6- |
harm    | [Am]?----------- |
bowl    | A2----------- |
bass    | A1----------- |

loop fall back
